 # Changelog
 
+## Unreleased (local branch feat/page-region-ai-vision)
+
+If the first OCR enhance retry still holds an item, a second scripted pass crops the question region from a 400 dpi render of the PDF page and reruns the same strict gate.
+
+An optional AI vision hook is off by default. Committed `review/ai-reads.json` files are read on the next run. AI text is accepted only when high-confidence OCR words appear in order, PDF text-layer words are covered, and type and key rules pass. Accepted items export with `reviewer_needed` true. Provenance stays in `export/ai-vision.json`. Otherwise the item stays on the review sheet with the AI text as a suggestion.
+
 ## Unreleased (local branch feat/ocr-retry-review)
 
 Automatic OCR retry for items held only for OCR quality: re-render the cropped image at about 3x (or raster a PDF page at 300-400 dpi when there is no image), enhance (grayscale, sharpen, contrast), and rerun both fidelity OCR passes. The same strict gate still applies. Settings live in `config/ocr.json` under `retry`. Each attempt is logged in `export/ocr-retry.json`.
